  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jVmUTGFMX5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1051116089133777016?color=green&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=green&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord 徽章\"></a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>全亮資源包</strong></h1><hr><h3>✨ 功能特色</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>亮度提升</strong>：全面增強亮度，讓所有環境清晰可見。</li>\n<li><strong>水下視野</strong>：即使在最深的海底也能看清周圍。</li>\n<li><strong>洞穴照明</strong>：探索洞穴和礦井無需攜帶火把。</li>\n<li><strong>明亮夜晚</strong>：夜晚行動如同白晝般清晰。</li>\n<li><strong>兼容其他資源包</strong>：可與其他資源包無縫搭配使用。</li>\n</ul><hr><h3>⚙️ 需求條件</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>OptiFine</strong>：此資源包需搭配 OptiFine 才能正常運作。<br>請確保在加入材質包前已安裝 OptiFine。</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>🖼️ 預覽畫面</h2><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Cc2HeoV.png\" alt=\"全亮效果展示\"></p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fblocklegend001%253fr%253dCurseforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/8fd2f0f5-1266-429b-b91c-d015a2026f31.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting 橫幅\"></a></p>",
